<title>EGYPT: TENNIS-PORTUGAL BEAT EGYPT 5-0 IN DAVIS CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-PORTUGAL BEAT EGYPT 5-0 IN DAVIS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal beat Egypt 5-0 in their Davis Cup tennis Euro/African zone group two match.</p>
<p>Final singles results on Sunday (Portuguese names first)</p>
<p>Joe Acunha beat Amr Ghuneim 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Emanuel Couto beat Jihad ad-Deeb 6-4 7-5.</p>
</text>
